# 团队标准

## Git 规范

### 分支策略

<!-- TODO: 确认以下分支策略是否符合团队习惯 -->

```mermaid
gitGraph
    commit
    branch develop
    checkout develop
    commit
    branch feature/xxx
    checkout feature/xxx
    commit
    commit
    checkout develop
    merge feature/xxx
    checkout main
    merge develop
```

| 分支类型 | 命名规则    | 用途     |
| -------- | ----------- | -------- |
| main     | main        | 生产环境 |
| develop  | develop     | 开发环境 |
| feature  | feature/xxx | 功能开发 |
| hotfix   | hotfix/xxx  | 紧急修复 |

### Commit 规范

<!-- TODO: 确认提交格式（建议沿用 Conventional Commits） -->

```
